        "segments": [
          {
            "segment_id": "segment-0",
            "text": "If your bank account has been debited but your order status on Tiki remains 'Awaiting Payment', this is typically due to transmission latency from the payment gateway. Our system and the payment gateway usually reconcile and update the order within 15-30 minutes. If your order remains unconfirmed after 1 hour, the system will automatically refund your original payment account within 24-72 business hours.",
