        "citations": [
          {
            "citation_id": "S1",
            "source_type": "kb_document",
            "document_id": "POL-PAY-001",
            "version": "1.0",
            "snippet": "Handling Payment Incidents and Banking Transactions on Tiki\nIf a customer's bank account or e-wallet is debited but the order on Tiki remains in 'Awaiting Payment' status or fails to display, this is typically due to transmission latency from the payment gateway. The Tiki system and payment gateway automatically reconcile and update the order within 15-30 minutes. If the order remains unconfirmed after 1 hour, the system will automatically refund the original payment account within 24-72 business hours."
          }
